Department of Chemistry and Biochemistry
Western Kentucky University
Bowling Green, KY 42101-1079
Email: jeremy.maddox@wku.edu\
\>", "Affiliation",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.988201549259402*^9, 
  3.988201579115401*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"76932808-fda7-41f0-8c18-\
d47bae9b3d1c"],

Cell["\<\
This developer verification notebook serves as the central hub for the \
GWPTools testing framework, strictly isolated from the user-facing \
documentation. Primarily, it provides an interactive sandbox for designing \
and prototyping new verification tests, allowing the developer to \
meticulously experiment with complex symbolic logic and specific integration \
constraints before formalizing them. Beyond test creation, the notebook acts \
as the master management utility for the existing suite, efficiently \
directing the batch execution of the modular .wl test files across all \
physical and architectural domains. It governs the persistent caching of test \
data by systematically serializing the computationally heavy TestReport \
objects. This architectural separation ensures that the formal mathematical \
proofs can be instantly loaded and seamlessly displayed within the public \
tutorials, completely insulating the end-user from the massive computational \
overhead required to generate them.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.988287889663212*^9, 3.9882879344154787`*^9}, {
   3.988288054016302*^9, 3.988288093480371*^9}, {3.9882881343524857`*^9, 
   3.988288135936454*^9}, 3.996335770542832*^9, {3.99633588402883*^9, 
   3.996335884414557*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"92aee5f6-c443-48d7-acba-\
d0c567007695"],

